WEBVTT

00:01.547 --> 00:02.927
[birds chirping]

00:03.007 --> 00:05.007
[♪ mysterious music playing]

00:14.897 --> 00:17.817
[Ruche whimpering]

00:38.587 --> 00:39.507
[gasps]

00:39.587 --> 00:41.257
-There it is.
-[gasps]

00:49.477 --> 00:51.387
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
<i>Angel's Playbox Entrance.</i>

00:51.477 --> 00:53.767
<i>Recommended level, 50.</i>

00:57.857 --> 01:00.817
[whooshing]

01:07.737 --> 01:09.077
[cape rustling]

01:12.787 --> 01:14.747
[gasps]

01:14.837 --> 01:16.167
[grunts]

01:25.837 --> 01:27.507
[both gasp]

01:27.597 --> 01:31.267
[PATCHWORK BEAR 1]
<i>Bear! Bear! Bear!</i>

01:31.347 --> 01:33.227
[grunts]

01:33.307 --> 01:35.437
[grunting]

01:43.737 --> 01:44.817
[gasps]

01:44.907 --> 01:47.027
[Patchwork Bear 1 roaring]

01:47.117 --> 01:50.697
-[Elymas grunting]
-[sword slashing]

01:51.617 --> 01:53.787
[grunts, yells]

01:57.997 --> 02:00.797
[Patchwork Bear 1 groans]

02:01.797 --> 02:02.967
[PATCHWORK BEAR 2] <i>Bear!</i>

02:03.047 --> 02:05.387
Okay, same plan as before.
Let's go.

02:05.467 --> 02:06.587
[grunts] Right!

02:07.257 --> 02:08.467
[Elymas grunts]

02:08.547 --> 02:10.467
-[Patchwork Bear 2 groans]
-[yells]

02:10.557 --> 02:12.477
[Patchwork Bear 2 groans]

02:12.557 --> 02:13.517
[sword slashes]

02:16.267 --> 02:17.937
[Ruche squeals delightedly]

02:18.567 --> 02:19.647
[giggles]

02:19.727 --> 02:22.567
How was that?
Am I being useful, Mr. Elymas?

02:22.647 --> 02:24.777
Yeah. Thank you.

02:24.857 --> 02:27.407
I feel really grateful
you decided to team up with me.

02:27.487 --> 02:29.407
[squeals excitedly]

02:29.487 --> 02:31.617
[giggling]

02:32.327 --> 02:33.617
Guess you wanted
to get your hands

02:33.697 --> 02:36.367
on these little Bear Shields
pretty badly, didn't you?

02:36.457 --> 02:38.037
Should we collect
10 more of them?

02:38.127 --> 02:40.457
[ELYMAS] No.
You've gained enough levels.

02:41.127 --> 02:42.797
The real work starts right now.

02:42.877 --> 02:44.257
Mm. Huh?

02:44.877 --> 02:46.427
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
<i>Level 20 has been reached.</i>

02:46.507 --> 02:49.507
[RUCHE] Oh, wow! You're right!
When did that happen?

02:50.177 --> 02:51.597
-[giggles]
-[ELYMAS] At this point,

02:51.677 --> 02:52.847
the new goal for us...

02:53.807 --> 02:55.597
is hunting Golden Raana.

02:55.687 --> 02:56.597
[gasps]

02:58.597 --> 03:00.817
Uh. Golden Raana?!

03:01.477 --> 03:02.397
[croaks]

03:02.977 --> 03:05.857
[♪ opening theme song playing]

04:16.347 --> 04:20.227
BEGIN ADVENTURE

04:33.067 --> 04:36.157
EPISODE 7
GOLDEN RAANA FARMING

04:36.237 --> 04:37.947
[Ruche gasps]

04:38.037 --> 04:40.037
[whimpers]

04:44.537 --> 04:45.497
[ELYMAS] <i>Raana.</i>

04:45.587 --> 04:47.087
<i>They're the frog monsters</i>
<i>I defeated</i>

04:47.167 --> 04:48.797
<i>after coming to this place.</i>

04:48.877 --> 04:51.047
<i>And when I played</i> Magic World,

04:51.127 --> 04:53.007
<i>they were quite</i>
<i>a beloved trash mob.</i>

04:54.427 --> 04:56.557
Rampart Reflection! [grunts]

04:56.637 --> 04:58.217
[electrical crackling]

04:58.307 --> 05:01.017
<i>Although there are</i>
<i>many variations out here,</i>

05:01.097 --> 05:02.137
<i>our current target</i>

05:02.227 --> 05:05.357
<i>is both the rarest</i>
<i>and most coveted,</i>

05:05.437 --> 05:06.937
<i>known as the Golden Raana.</i>

05:07.727 --> 05:10.277
<i>Given the situation</i>
<i>we're in now,</i>

05:10.357 --> 05:11.777
<i>I determined our best move</i>

05:11.857 --> 05:13.657
<i>would be to farm</i>
<i>this dungeon next.</i>

05:14.447 --> 05:17.447
<i>The Golden Raana has</i>
<i>a really low spawn rate,</i>

05:17.527 --> 05:19.867
<i>but what makes them</i>
<i>so sought after</i>

05:19.947 --> 05:21.497
<i>is the high chance</i>
<i>that they'll drop</i>

05:21.577 --> 05:23.957
<i>an unbelievably valuable item.</i>

05:24.037 --> 05:25.167
[Golden Raana croaks]

05:25.247 --> 05:28.547
Furthermore, their Attack
and Magic are extremely low

05:28.627 --> 05:29.917
despite having such high levels,

05:30.007 --> 05:32.087
and they lack
any offensive skills.

05:32.797 --> 05:34.427
-Ah?
-In short,

05:34.507 --> 05:37.927
<i>these things are weak in combat,</i>
<i>offer tons of XP,</i>

05:38.007 --> 05:40.807
and provide
truly valuable drops.

05:40.887 --> 05:43.847
So you couldn't ask
for a juicier monster!

05:43.937 --> 05:45.307
Oh!

05:45.397 --> 05:46.857
[ELYMAS] <i>Luckily,</i>
<i>there are a good number</i>

05:46.937 --> 05:48.687
<i>of bonus characters</i>
<i>like the Golden Raana.</i>

05:49.397 --> 05:50.647
<i>Or, as they're</i>
<i>affectionately known</i>

05:50.737 --> 05:52.817
<i>in</i> Magic World, <i>Golden Toads.</i>

05:53.397 --> 05:55.317
<i>And a large number</i>
<i>of players would tell you</i>

05:55.407 --> 05:56.987
<i>that farming them</i>
<i>was their favorite part</i>

05:57.067 --> 05:58.117
<i>of the entire game.</i>

06:03.327 --> 06:05.207
<i>They frequently spawn</i>
<i>in the middle of levels</i>

06:05.287 --> 06:06.957
<i>in the Angel's Playbox,</i>

06:07.037 --> 06:08.587
<i>so this is where</i>
<i>we need to search.</i>

06:09.707 --> 06:10.627
<i>We have an advantage</i>

06:10.707 --> 06:12.377
<i>when it comes to hunting</i>
<i>the different monsters</i>

06:12.457 --> 06:13.427
<i>that appear in this dungeon.</i>

06:14.217 --> 06:16.427
<i>I know where each one</i>
<i>is likely to be.</i>

06:16.507 --> 06:18.467
-[Ruche grunts]
-[gasps]

06:18.557 --> 06:21.927
Hey, um, I've heard things
about the Golden Raana too.

06:22.017 --> 06:23.177
They say a person

06:23.267 --> 06:25.937
can live off of just one
of those things for years.

06:26.017 --> 06:27.397
Well, at least
that's what the adventurers

06:27.477 --> 06:28.817
at the bar told me.

06:28.897 --> 06:32.067
Really? That makes things
even simpler, then.

06:32.147 --> 06:34.607
[RUCHE] But they also mentioned
something else.

06:35.897 --> 06:38.067
Apparently,
they can move so fast

06:38.157 --> 06:40.197
that they're almost
impossible to catch.

06:40.277 --> 06:41.697
And even if you land a hit,

06:41.787 --> 06:43.497
they still
don't take any damage.

06:43.577 --> 06:45.207
-[croaks]
-[RUCHE] <i>It's not unusual</i>

06:45.287 --> 06:47.497
<i>for people to chase them farther</i>
<i>than they expected,</i>

06:47.577 --> 06:49.497
<i>and then</i>
<i>they find themselves surrounded</i>

06:49.587 --> 06:51.497
<i>by a whole bunch of monsters.</i>

06:51.587 --> 06:53.877
[whimpers] It's been said

06:53.957 --> 06:55.257
that adventurers have died

06:55.337 --> 06:56.837
because of those
awful little creatures!

06:56.927 --> 06:59.137
So they're a lot more dangerous
than you might think they are!

06:59.217 --> 07:00.927
[whimpering]

07:01.007 --> 07:03.057
[ELYMAS] <i>Mm. That's right.</i>

07:03.137 --> 07:05.727
<i>This world and the game</i>
<i>are two different things.</i>

07:05.807 --> 07:07.637
<i>Out here, death is the end.</i>

07:08.267 --> 07:10.107
<i>People naturally tend</i>
<i>to choose safe,</i>

07:10.187 --> 07:12.357
<i>dependable builds</i>
<i>for their survival.</i>

07:12.437 --> 07:14.027
-[monsters growling]
-[adventurer whimpers]

07:14.107 --> 07:15.067
<i>Farming Golden Raana</i>

07:15.147 --> 07:16.857
<i>must be more difficult</i>
<i>than I thought.</i>

07:16.947 --> 07:17.857
<i>After all,</i>

07:18.777 --> 07:19.697
<i>those things are imbued</i>

07:19.777 --> 07:21.777
<i>with extraordinary</i>
<i>Speed and Defense.</i>

07:22.527 --> 07:23.867
[croaks]

07:24.657 --> 07:27.407
<i>They're also totally immune</i>
<i>to elemental attacks,</i>

07:27.497 --> 07:30.627
<i>status effects,</i>
<i>and debuffs of any kind.</i>

07:31.287 --> 07:33.797
Ah! If we went up
against a monster like that,

07:33.877 --> 07:35.667
don't you think
we'd be powerless?!

07:35.757 --> 07:37.547
I mean, sure,
the Ironpiercer knife

07:37.627 --> 07:38.797
you gave me is really effective

07:38.887 --> 07:41.097
going up against
high-Defense targets.

07:41.177 --> 07:44.677
But I seriously have my doubts
it would do any damage

07:44.767 --> 07:46.097
to a Golden Raana.

07:46.177 --> 07:50.107
That said, I don't think I could
even catch up to one anyway.

07:50.187 --> 07:52.437
Hmm. Yeah, you're right.

07:53.897 --> 07:55.527
We're talking about creatures
that possess

07:55.607 --> 07:58.317
a Speed of 67
and Defense of 200.

07:59.737 --> 08:02.527
<i>And Ironpiercer's</i>
<i>15% Defense Penetration</i>

08:02.617 --> 08:04.327
<i>would be completely ineffective</i>
<i>against them,</i>

08:04.407 --> 08:05.787
-unfortunately.
-[sighs]

08:06.657 --> 08:07.827
So then--

08:07.907 --> 08:09.367
[ELYMAS] <i>As a Pierrot,</i>

08:09.457 --> 08:11.327
<i>Ruche is swift</i>
<i>and light on her feet.</i>

08:11.417 --> 08:13.837
<i>But its Speed is still</i>
<i>more than double hers.</i>

08:13.917 --> 08:15.877
<i>As a slow Heavy Knight,</i>
<i>on the other hand,</i>

08:15.957 --> 08:18.467
<i>it can reach speeds</i>
<i>that are more than triple mine.</i>

08:19.047 --> 08:20.887
<i>Also, its Defense is 200.</i>

08:21.837 --> 08:23.467
<i>Which means that</i>
<i>even if I were to execute</i>

08:23.557 --> 08:25.307
<i>a perfect Rampart Reflection,</i>

08:25.387 --> 08:27.467
<i>it would be rendered</i>
<i>ineffective.</i>

08:28.267 --> 08:29.767
<i>Like Ironpiercer,</i>

08:29.847 --> 08:32.767
<i>Vital Slice has</i>
<i>15% Defense Penetration.</i>

08:32.857 --> 08:35.767
<i>So it's not enough</i>
<i>to deal any real damage.</i>

08:35.857 --> 08:37.277
-[RUCHE] Are, uh--
-Hmm?

08:37.357 --> 08:39.817
Are we sure
this isn't impossible now?

08:40.397 --> 08:41.697
-Don't worry.
-[gasps]

08:41.777 --> 08:43.777
Because I've got a plan.

08:43.867 --> 08:45.277
[gasps]

08:45.367 --> 08:48.287
Even its seemingly
perfect defense has holes,

08:48.367 --> 08:50.117
so we'll use them
to our advantage.

08:50.207 --> 08:51.247
Huh?!

08:51.877 --> 08:53.917
But-- But do you have any skills

08:53.997 --> 08:55.627
that can really damage
something as durable

08:55.707 --> 08:56.917
as a Golden Raana?

08:57.007 --> 08:59.087
Because honestly,
I've never heard

08:59.167 --> 09:00.917
of Heavy Knights
having anything like that.

09:01.007 --> 09:01.927
[chuckles]

09:02.677 --> 09:03.597
Uh?

09:06.217 --> 09:07.597
'Kay, Ruche, you've got this.

09:07.677 --> 09:09.477
[gasps] Hang on!

09:09.557 --> 09:12.597
You're counting on me?!

09:13.187 --> 09:15.147
Anyway, after all
the leveling you've done

09:15.227 --> 09:17.147
while grinding
through the monsters here,

09:17.227 --> 09:18.777
you should have
eight skill points.

09:18.857 --> 09:19.817
[gasps]

09:19.897 --> 09:21.817
[ELYMAS] Right now,
you need to put all of them

09:21.897 --> 09:23.697
into the Fool's Acrobatics.

09:23.777 --> 09:25.827
The two skills you'll need
are going to be essential

09:25.907 --> 09:27.487
to making our strategy work.

09:28.907 --> 09:31.457
Uh, I'm glad to know
you've got high hopes for me

09:31.537 --> 09:34.127
and actually believe
I'll be able to pull this off.

09:34.207 --> 09:35.837
But I just don't have
that kind of power.

09:35.917 --> 09:38.167
-[♪ dramatic music playing]
-[gasps]

09:38.797 --> 09:40.417
-[monster grunting]
-[gasps]

09:41.917 --> 09:43.467
-[Elymas grunts]
-[monster growls]

09:43.587 --> 09:45.637
-[sword slashes]
-[monster groaning]

09:47.097 --> 09:48.137
[Ruche gasps]

09:48.217 --> 09:49.557
[gasps]

09:50.227 --> 09:52.887
[ELYMAS] Okay, Ruche.
Let's run while we can.

09:52.977 --> 09:54.937
[RUCHE] Okay. I think
I could finish it off,

09:55.017 --> 09:56.147
but you're sure, right?

09:56.227 --> 09:58.437
Yeah. That isn't the target
we're after,

09:58.517 --> 10:00.067
and the minute
it feels like it's cornered,

10:00.147 --> 10:02.147
it'll start summoning
its allies here.

10:02.237 --> 10:04.317
[gasps] Are you sure
we really want to narrow

10:04.407 --> 10:05.567
our focus to Golden Raana

10:05.657 --> 10:08.367
and run past any other monsters
we cross paths with?

10:08.447 --> 10:09.697
With all your civility
and knowledge,

10:09.787 --> 10:11.537
if we could defeat
the other ones we find

10:11.617 --> 10:13.157
while making our way
through this place,

10:13.247 --> 10:14.667
I could probably gain
three more levels

10:14.747 --> 10:16.577
before we even reach
the end of the day.

10:16.667 --> 10:18.627
It's fine. At our current level,

10:18.707 --> 10:20.507
farming Golden Raana
is the perfect way

10:20.587 --> 10:21.917
to make progress quickly.

10:22.007 --> 10:24.167
[panting] Huh?

10:26.757 --> 10:29.597
Good. That thing
isn't coming after us.

10:30.387 --> 10:31.347
[Ruche grunts]

10:32.017 --> 10:33.177
[sighs heavily]

10:33.267 --> 10:34.437
Well, I assumed we wouldn't find

10:34.517 --> 10:36.267
what we're looking for
right away.

10:36.347 --> 10:37.477
Are you serious?

10:37.557 --> 10:39.647
Yes. Even if we were
to search all day,

10:39.727 --> 10:41.277
we might come across
two of them.

10:41.357 --> 10:42.857
[Ruche gasps] Wait.

10:42.937 --> 10:46.197
You mean those little creatures
are really that rare?

10:46.277 --> 10:47.777
-Indeed.
-[gasps]

10:49.117 --> 10:50.907
But Golden Raana
are worth every bit

10:50.987 --> 10:52.787
of our time and effort.

10:52.867 --> 10:54.907
[whimpers, gulps]

10:56.037 --> 10:59.287
That said, no matter how high
your Luck stat may be,

10:59.377 --> 11:01.667
they're still a pretty
difficult monster to encounter.

11:02.457 --> 11:03.547
Just let me know if you begin

11:03.627 --> 11:05.717
to feel anxious or unhappy,
okay?

11:06.507 --> 11:07.837
[Ruche grunts]

11:07.927 --> 11:09.717
-Don't you worry!
-Hmm?

11:09.797 --> 11:12.217
I was only a little anxious,
that's all.

11:12.307 --> 11:15.227
I'll follow you wherever you go,
Mr. Elymas.

11:15.847 --> 11:17.347
I appreciate it,

11:17.437 --> 11:19.607
but there's no reason
for you to hold back.

11:19.687 --> 11:23.107
Let's go farm 100
or even 1,000 Golden Raana!

11:23.187 --> 11:24.897
I'm ready
to show you I can do it!

11:24.987 --> 11:26.397
[laughs awkwardly]

11:26.487 --> 11:28.617
[ELYMAS] <i>I'm glad</i>
<i>to hear she's feeling motivated,</i>

11:29.237 --> 11:31.617
<i>but Rondalm's market</i>
<i>would be thrown into total chaos</i>

11:31.697 --> 11:33.237
<i>if we managed to farm that many.</i>

11:33.327 --> 11:34.247
Huh?

11:35.657 --> 11:36.747
[croaks]

11:40.037 --> 11:41.247
[croaks]

11:41.337 --> 11:42.707
Um, isn't that...

11:45.257 --> 11:46.167
[croaks]

11:47.047 --> 11:47.967
[gasps]

11:48.547 --> 11:49.797
[gasps]

11:49.887 --> 11:51.757
[Raana croaking]

11:54.387 --> 11:55.887
[both gasp]

11:57.727 --> 11:59.267
[ELYMAS] A Golden Raana!

12:00.437 --> 12:01.397
[croaks]

12:02.557 --> 12:03.517
[Ruche grunts]

12:04.147 --> 12:05.397
-Don't you worry!
-Hmm?

12:05.487 --> 12:08.567
I'll follow you
wherever you go, Mr. Elymas.

12:08.647 --> 12:10.197
Huh?

12:10.817 --> 12:11.947
[croaks]

12:15.247 --> 12:16.447
[croaks]

12:16.537 --> 12:17.957
Um, isn't that...

12:20.537 --> 12:21.457
[croaks]

12:22.167 --> 12:23.877
[both gasp]

12:23.957 --> 12:25.667
[croaking]

12:28.467 --> 12:29.837
[both gasp]

12:31.757 --> 12:33.257
[ELYMAS] A Golden Raana!

12:34.717 --> 12:36.517
[croaks]

12:36.597 --> 12:38.807
[grunts, gasps]

12:38.887 --> 12:41.307
We found one a lot sooner
than I was expecting.

12:41.397 --> 12:42.307
[Ruche gasps]

12:42.397 --> 12:44.607
We finally saw one.
We finally saw one.

12:44.687 --> 12:46.317
What are we supposed to do now?

12:46.397 --> 12:48.487
Just take deep breaths, Ruche.

12:48.567 --> 12:49.567
-[gasps]
-To defeat this thing,

12:49.647 --> 12:51.607
we need to remain calm
and collected.

12:51.697 --> 12:53.407
[Ruche gasps] Got it.

12:54.407 --> 12:56.287
[breathing deeply]

12:56.367 --> 12:58.617
EXHALE
INHALE

12:59.207 --> 13:00.117
-[croaks]
-[Ruche gasps]

13:00.207 --> 13:02.787
Were you able
to raise Fool's Acrobatics to 10

13:02.877 --> 13:05.087
using your skill points
from leveling up earlier?

13:05.167 --> 13:06.587
[gasps] Yes!

13:06.667 --> 13:09.337
And I acquired
the two skills you mentioned.

13:09.417 --> 13:11.007
Do you really think
they'll help us out?

13:11.087 --> 13:13.507
Yes. Now let's go through
with the plan.

13:13.597 --> 13:15.387
Mm. Okay!

13:17.717 --> 13:20.267
[ELYMAS] I'll stand right here
and wait for the Golden Raana.

13:20.347 --> 13:23.097
Get on the other side
and start herding it towards me.

13:25.357 --> 13:27.267
[whimpering]

13:27.357 --> 13:28.277
[ELYMAS] Ruche?

13:28.357 --> 13:30.237
You've so got this, Ruche.
I can do it,

13:30.317 --> 13:32.777
I can do it, I can do it,
I can do it, I--

13:32.857 --> 13:34.777
I can do it, I can do it.

13:34.867 --> 13:35.777
I can do it. I can do it.

13:35.867 --> 13:37.737
[ELYMAS] Hey there, no pressure.

13:37.827 --> 13:39.287
It's all right if you mess up.

13:39.367 --> 13:40.327
[RUCHE] Tense, tense, tense...

13:40.407 --> 13:42.287
Just take a few
big breaths, okay?

13:42.367 --> 13:43.787
[Ruche gasps]

13:43.877 --> 13:48.297
[taking deep breaths]

13:49.877 --> 13:51.337
♪

13:51.417 --> 13:52.967
I'm good to go, sir.

13:55.427 --> 13:58.387
Now let's get this Raana!

13:58.467 --> 14:00.427
[ELYMAS] <i>Golden Raana</i>
<i>begin fleeing</i>

14:00.517 --> 14:03.387
<i>when they sense an adventurer</i>
<i>within a four-meter proximity.</i>

14:04.437 --> 14:05.977
<i>Coincidentally,</i>

14:06.057 --> 14:07.727
<i>the corridors</i>
<i>in the Angel's Playbox</i>

14:07.817 --> 14:09.107
<i>are four meters wide.</i>

14:09.187 --> 14:10.107
[croaks]

14:10.187 --> 14:13.237
<i>Even if a Golden Raana</i>
<i>is hugging the edges,</i>

14:13.317 --> 14:15.947
<i>there's not enough distance</i>
<i>to sneak by undetected.</i>

14:16.617 --> 14:18.527
-[Ruche panting]
-<i>However,</i>

14:18.617 --> 14:21.247
<i>that's only</i>
<i>if you're walking on the floor.</i>

14:21.327 --> 14:23.037
[Ruche panting]

14:25.377 --> 14:27.457
[RUCHE] Acrobatic Amble!

14:28.627 --> 14:30.757
[panting]

14:31.337 --> 14:32.257
[grunts]

14:32.337 --> 14:33.257
[croaks]

14:36.887 --> 14:39.347
[croaking]

14:39.427 --> 14:41.017
There's no escape!

14:41.097 --> 14:44.517
Doppellusion!

14:44.597 --> 14:45.727
DOPPELLUSION

14:45.807 --> 14:47.977
[gasps] <i>These narrow corridors</i>

14:48.057 --> 14:50.477
<i>make slipping past</i>
<i>those illusions impossible.</i>

14:50.567 --> 14:53.027
<i>And Golden Raana</i>
<i>are far too cowardly</i>

14:53.107 --> 14:54.567
<i>to charge into them.</i>

14:54.647 --> 14:56.107
<i>It's a sitting duck.</i>

14:57.067 --> 14:58.027
<i>They can't be blinded,</i>

14:58.117 --> 15:00.777
<i>thanks to their immunity</i>
<i>to status effects.</i>

15:00.867 --> 15:02.657
<i>Hallucinate doesn't work</i>
<i>for the same reason.</i>

15:03.367 --> 15:05.247
<i>Thankfully,</i>
<i>they can still be fooled</i>

15:05.327 --> 15:07.497
<i>by the illusions</i>
<i>created by Doppellusion.</i>

15:08.327 --> 15:10.127
<i>It's a weak spot</i>
<i>in their resistances</i>

15:10.207 --> 15:12.257
<i>that we can take advantage of.</i>

15:13.087 --> 15:14.167
[gasps]

15:14.257 --> 15:16.297
Watch out!
It's running your direction!

15:16.377 --> 15:18.297
[croaking]

15:18.387 --> 15:20.797
[ELYMAS] <i>What also works well</i>

15:20.887 --> 15:22.387
<i>is Shadow Stomp!</i>

15:22.467 --> 15:23.387
[grunts]

15:24.177 --> 15:26.517
[ELYMAS] <i>It all comes down</i>
<i>to whether or not I can land it.</i>

15:28.477 --> 15:30.107
<i>The narrow corridors help,</i>

15:30.187 --> 15:32.227
<i>but it's still three times</i>
<i>faster than me.</i>

15:32.317 --> 15:34.857
<i>Plus my shadow's</i>
<i>only 50 centimeters long.</i>

15:35.277 --> 15:36.897
[sighs] <i>Enough of that.</i>

15:36.987 --> 15:39.277
[croaking]

15:39.367 --> 15:41.237
This was my idea
in the first place,

15:41.327 --> 15:42.527
and I'm not going to fail!

15:44.827 --> 15:47.497
<i>I bought these Magic Stones</i>
<i>when we got Ironpiercer.</i>

15:48.077 --> 15:49.417
<i>Their healing effects</i>
<i>are too weak</i>

15:49.497 --> 15:51.377
<i>to make them worth using.</i>

15:51.457 --> 15:52.877
[croaking]

15:54.417 --> 15:56.417
<i>But they can also do this!</i>

15:56.507 --> 15:57.507
[grunts]

16:01.847 --> 16:03.217
[croaks]

16:07.427 --> 16:08.937
[Elymas grunts]

16:09.017 --> 16:10.307
Shadow Stomp!

16:10.397 --> 16:12.307
[struggling]

16:12.397 --> 16:14.317
[croaks]

16:14.397 --> 16:17.147
Golden Raana, we've got you now!

16:17.737 --> 16:19.407
Mr. Elymas, we trapped it!

16:19.487 --> 16:20.777
[giggles]

16:20.867 --> 16:23.777
That loot and XP
is as good as ours!

16:23.867 --> 16:25.787
[croaking]

16:25.867 --> 16:27.327
[Ruche giggles]

16:27.407 --> 16:28.997
Wait. It may be stuck,

16:29.077 --> 16:31.287
but how are you
supposed to actually kill it?

16:31.377 --> 16:32.287
[croaking]

16:32.377 --> 16:34.287
FLAIL

16:34.377 --> 16:37.417
We can only hurt it
by landing critical hits on it.

16:38.467 --> 16:39.877
[RUCHE] <i>Critical hits?!</i>

16:40.507 --> 16:41.967
-[knight grunts]
-[ELYMAS] <i>Yes.</i>

16:42.047 --> 16:42.967
[AUTOMATED VOICE] <i>Critical.</i>

16:43.047 --> 16:44.257
[ELYMAS] <i>When you're able</i>
<i>to successfully read</i>

16:44.347 --> 16:45.557
<i>your opponent's movements</i>

16:45.637 --> 16:48.057
<i>and land what would</i>
<i>be considered the perfect hit,</i>

16:48.137 --> 16:50.557
you deal 1.5 times the damage

16:50.637 --> 16:52.477
and ignore half
your target's defense.

16:52.557 --> 16:53.687
I get it now!

16:53.767 --> 16:55.477
And since
the Golden Raana's trapped,

16:55.567 --> 16:57.187
you can try for
as many critical hits

16:57.277 --> 16:58.857
as you need, right?

16:58.937 --> 17:01.867
[chuckles] I believe in you.
Best of luck!

17:01.947 --> 17:04.077
Well,
my critical hits won't deal

17:04.157 --> 17:05.407
enough damage to affect it,

17:05.487 --> 17:07.447
so someone else
needs to finish it off.

17:07.537 --> 17:08.997
Oh. Huh?

17:09.077 --> 17:11.997
It's like I said,
I'm counting on you, Ruche.

17:12.627 --> 17:13.957
What?!

17:14.837 --> 17:17.797
[ELYMAS] <i>Landing critical hits</i>
<i>requires both skill and luck.</i>

17:17.877 --> 17:19.467
-[knight grunts]
-[AUTOMATED VOICE] <i>Critical.</i>

17:20.297 --> 17:22.177
[ELYMAS] <i>And obviously,</i>
<i>I'm in no position</i>

17:22.257 --> 17:24.967
<i>to go for critical hits</i>
<i>right now, since I can't move.</i>

17:25.057 --> 17:28.307
But-- But-- But I barely
ever scored any critical hits!

17:28.387 --> 17:30.977
How am I supposed
to get them now?

17:31.057 --> 17:32.977
It'd be impossible
with normal attacks,

17:33.057 --> 17:35.107
but don't forget
about the original skill

17:35.187 --> 17:37.357
that you already had
when we got here.

17:37.437 --> 17:38.727
Remember Dice Thrust?

17:38.817 --> 17:42.067
[gasps] Wait. You want me
to use Dice Thrust?

17:42.777 --> 17:44.527
Ruche. Listen.

17:44.617 --> 17:46.157
You may be risking your life
out there,

17:46.237 --> 17:48.367
but you still don't have
any decent attack skills.

17:48.447 --> 17:50.657
You just stand around
and soak up hits.

17:50.747 --> 17:52.457
Truth is,
you aren't useful to us.

17:53.037 --> 17:55.497
You managed to finally learn
an attack skill, huh?

17:55.587 --> 17:56.537
[gasps]

17:56.627 --> 17:58.747
But it's less useful
than a normal attack.

17:58.837 --> 18:00.877
Can't say I'm surprised one bit.

18:00.957 --> 18:01.877
[sighs]

18:03.127 --> 18:04.087
That skill...

18:04.967 --> 18:08.307
[AUTOMATED VOICE] <i>Skill,</i>
<i>Dice Thrust. A thrusting skill.</i>

18:08.387 --> 18:10.637
<i>Rolls a six-sided die</i>
<i>and grants a bonus effect</i>

18:10.717 --> 18:12.767
<i>based on the rolled result.</i>

18:14.227 --> 18:15.187
Hmm?

18:19.687 --> 18:22.357
Yeah. I guess that could work!

18:22.987 --> 18:24.857
See? A six gets you...

18:24.947 --> 18:26.867
[BOTH] A guaranteed critical!

18:27.447 --> 18:29.117
[ELYMAS] <i>Rolling a six</i>
<i>multiplies your attack</i>

18:29.197 --> 18:30.327
<i>by 1.3,</i>

18:30.407 --> 18:32.497
<i>and also guarantees</i>
<i>a critical hit.</i>

18:34.577 --> 18:37.837
<i>That's a total of 1.95 times</i>
<i>the base damage.</i>

18:37.917 --> 18:41.417
<i>On top of that,</i>
<i>Ironpiercer's 15% Penetration</i>

18:41.507 --> 18:44.167
<i>and a Critical's</i>
<i>50% Penetration stack.</i>

18:45.387 --> 18:48.927
<i>So a six ultimately hits</i>
<i>with 1.95 times attack</i>

18:49.007 --> 18:51.307
<i>and 65% Defense Penetration.</i>

18:51.387 --> 18:52.557
[gasps]

18:52.637 --> 18:54.057
-[croaking]
-[RUCHE] Still,

18:54.137 --> 18:56.057
do you really think
this can work?

18:56.147 --> 18:58.477
Some classes
may be late bloomers,

18:58.567 --> 19:01.067
and some skills may have
limited use cases.

19:01.687 --> 19:04.067
But no class
or skill is useless.

19:05.067 --> 19:06.737
Don't let
the short-sighted assessments

19:06.817 --> 19:08.237
of others bother you.

19:08.317 --> 19:10.077
And as far as
Cline's party goes,

19:10.787 --> 19:13.077
you only seemed
underwhelming to them.

19:14.747 --> 19:16.077
I'll say it again, Ruche.

19:16.877 --> 19:19.207
I need you in my party. Got it?

19:19.917 --> 19:21.127
[gasps]

19:21.207 --> 19:23.297
I hope you'll keep
lending me your strength.

19:26.927 --> 19:28.047
[grunts]

19:33.097 --> 19:34.017
[RUCHE] I'll do it.

19:34.097 --> 19:36.097
If someone has
that much faith in me,

19:36.187 --> 19:38.097
I won't let them down! [panting]

19:38.857 --> 19:41.607
Otherwise, what's the point
in being an adventurer?

19:41.687 --> 19:44.357
Yeah! All right! Let's go!

19:44.437 --> 19:46.447
[panting]

19:49.737 --> 19:51.987
Dice Thrust!

19:52.077 --> 19:53.537
[grunts]

19:54.117 --> 19:55.287
[gasps]

19:59.377 --> 20:00.287
[grunts]

20:07.507 --> 20:09.007
[squeals excitedly]

20:09.087 --> 20:10.797
[gasps, chuckles]

20:10.887 --> 20:12.927
[croaks]

20:13.007 --> 20:13.927
[AUTOMATED VOICE] <i>Critical.</i>

20:16.887 --> 20:18.307
[Ruche grunts]

20:21.897 --> 20:23.267
[grunts]

20:24.937 --> 20:26.277
-[Golden Raana groans]
-[thuds]

20:29.657 --> 20:31.157
[clinking]

20:32.327 --> 20:34.327
[Ruche gasps]

20:34.407 --> 20:36.577
Whoa. We actually did it!

20:37.327 --> 20:39.827
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
<i>Level 27 has been reached.</i>

20:39.917 --> 20:41.497
There's no way!

20:41.577 --> 20:44.417
I made it
all the way to level 27!

20:46.377 --> 20:47.417
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
<i>Level 30 has been reached.</i>

20:47.507 --> 20:50.427
It's nice that Golden Raana
are worth a lot of EXP.

20:50.507 --> 20:52.007
But the best part

20:52.097 --> 20:54.427
is the valuable items
they can drop.

20:55.307 --> 20:57.927
The drop rate is right at 50%.

20:58.017 --> 20:59.097
[gasps]

21:11.027 --> 21:12.197
[gasps]

21:12.277 --> 21:13.367
[gasps]

21:18.537 --> 21:20.207
[squeals excitedly]

21:20.287 --> 21:21.707
[chuckles excitedly]

21:21.787 --> 21:24.287
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
<i>Dazzling Raana Decorative Blade.</i>

21:24.377 --> 21:26.047
<i>Attack, plus 12.</i>

21:26.127 --> 21:28.707
<i>Market price, 17 million gold.</i>

21:28.797 --> 21:30.877
<i>A glittering Raana short sword.</i>

21:30.967 --> 21:33.217
<i>A hunk</i>
<i>of high-purity Raana Gold.</i>

21:33.297 --> 21:34.467
[squeals excitedly]

21:34.547 --> 21:37.057
Whoa. A Dazzling Raana
Decorative Blade!

21:40.977 --> 21:42.977
[♪ closing theme song playing]

23:10.937 --> 23:12.857
[ELYMAS] <i>Both Ruche and I</i>
<i>gained tons of levels</i>

23:12.937 --> 23:14.947
<i>by killing the Golden Raana.</i>

23:15.027 --> 23:16.197
<i>But it's still not enough.</i>

23:16.987 --> 23:18.617
<i>That loot drop</i>
<i>was only worth a fraction</i>

23:18.697 --> 23:20.537
<i>of what it will cost</i>
<i>to buy that skillbook.</i>

23:22.947 --> 23:25.327
<i>Grinding levels</i>
<i>and stockpiling gold</i>

23:25.407 --> 23:26.327
<i>is a lot of fun.</i>

23:27.577 --> 23:29.837
<i>However,</i>
<i>this world isn't a game.</i>

23:32.587 --> 23:34.627
<i>Next time, "Wandering."</i>

23:35.297 --> 23:37.637
<i>Falling in this world</i>
<i>means dying for real.</i>

23:37.717 --> 23:39.347
<i>Being gone forever.</i>
